# Class declaration with injective: true flag on the resolver metadata.
# Verifies that injective: true parses and type-checks without error.
[
  TestClass: [class [let TestClass a b c]
    [determines: [[[a b] c]]
     resolver: TestResolver
     injective: true]
    test: [Fn@c [a b]]]

  result: "ok"
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("ok")
